 pour les primo-accédants\nLa résidence ALTESSE est divisée en 2 tranches =\nTranche 1: Bâtiment A/B et Tranche 2: Bâtiments C/D\nPlanning de la tranche 2 - BAT C/D = Actabilité : 4ème trimestre 2026 - Livraison : 4ème trimestre 2028","addr":"Rue Averroès","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OGY4ZjliNjIwMTg3MS44NjE1NDQ5MCIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6ImYzMzkyMTUxMWFhOGRkN2JmOWUzZmM2OTk0NjE3YmQ0ODhhZGZkMTA5ZDZkZWViYjJjZjIyMGE1YTY3MDliMGMifQ==?signature=f5ac312de39ca2a19978d3fae68e88f6904f4f0d4ec478427700e1a3b6cf7034","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OGY4ZjliNjNlNjE2MS4wMjU0MjI2NCIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6IjgzZjUwMGRiZmE0MmFmNDY0Y2FkZWU0N2VlNDFmZTMyZjcyNDI3MzU1ZjE3Njc0NzlkZGUyNzEyOWIzZTA4NzIifQ==?signature=cdfbcafd5df0ff2ddc561693116ee1bce91ab78cc9ff70e881d575e3f6acdab4","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OGY4ZjliNjQ5ZDkwNy4yMTQ4NzIxOCIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6IjU3Y2I4NTQ5M2U3MTMwZTBiZGJkZWNlMjVlYTNjMmI0ZWNjZWE0NjBiMDE5OTQzOGZjOWI0NTVmYzExZDgyYzEifQ==?signature=8477621b759c6eebe644b2935ddced39c14989eceebaa97e6b8bde6ad67de1e4","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OGY4ZjlkOWMzZjQ4OS4xNDY2MTU2NSIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6IjQ3NGEzN2JhM2ZlZWE0OWViNzI3MWEwNGRkM2Y1ZmU2OWU1MzZhYzcwMTY2ZTdkNGZmNzE4YjBjZGE1NjRlMTIifQ==?signature=c493c43a0cc4cba7df29a729b9db7a4554b0c4ec69aa45a8dc37b8f158bc34e5"],"yt":[],"vr":[],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcy